	<element name="Frontiers of Eberron: Quickstone" type="Source" source="Core" id="ID_VPD_SOURCE_FRONTIERS_OF_EBERRON_QUICKSTONE">
		<description>
			<p>Journey across the Western Frontier, the contested land that lies between the ancient kingdom of Breland and the rising nation of Droaam. <i>Frontiers of Eberron: Quickstone</i> takes a deep dive into this untamed region, exploring the towns and denizens of this dangerous land. Discover new character options and play as a harpy, gargoyle, or medusa "monster" species in the introductory "Heart of Stone" adventure, all included in this adventure sourcebook!</p>
		</description>
